<div class="admin-panel publications-editor" data-publications-editor>
  <div class="admin-panel-head"><div><p class="kicker dark">Publicaciones</p><h2>Cuaderno y contenidos SEO</h2></div><button class="button outline" type="button" data-post-new>Nueva publicación</button></div>
  <p>Redacta en borrador, completa ES y EN, revisa la vista previa y publica cuando esté listo. El texto admite párrafos separados por una línea en blanco.</p>
  <div class="publication-workspace"><aside data-post-list></aside><form data-post-form hidden><input type="hidden" name="id"/><div class="design-options"><label class="field"><span>Slug estable</span><input name="slug" pattern="[a-z0-9-]+" placeholder="barcelona-entre-capas" required/></label><label class="field"><span>Estado</span><select name="status"><option value="draft">Borrador</option><option value="published">Publicado</option><option value="archived">Archivado</option></select></label><label class="field"><span>Etiquetas, separadas por coma</span><input name="tags" placeholder="Barcelona, arquitectura, Eixample"/></label></div>
    <label class="field"><span>Imagen de portada</span><input name="coverFile" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif"/></label><input name="coverUrl" type="hidden"/><img class="post-cover-preview" data-post-cover alt="Vista previa de portada"/>
    <div class="bilingual-editor"><div><h3>Castellano</h3><label class="field"><span>Título</span><input name="title_es" required/></label><label class="field"><span>Resumen corto</span><textarea name="excerpt_es" rows="3" maxlength="320"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Artículo</span><textarea name="body_es" rows="14"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Título SEO</span><input name="seo_title_es" maxlength="65"/></label><label class="field"><span>Descripción SEO</span><textarea name="seo_description_es" rows="2" maxlength="160"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Alt de portada</span><input name="cover_alt_es"/></label></div><div><h3>English</h3><label class="field"><span>Title</span><input name="title_en"/></label><label class="field"><span>Short summary</span><textarea name="excerpt_en" rows="3" maxlength="320"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Article</span><textarea name="body_en" rows="14"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>SEO title</span><input name="seo_title_en" maxlength="65"/></label><label class="field"><span>SEO description</span><textarea name="seo_description_en" rows="2" maxlength="160"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Cover alt</span><input name="cover_alt_en"/></label></div></div><p class="admin-error" data-post-message></p><div class="route-editor-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit">Guardar</button><button class="button outline" type="button" data-post-close>Cerrar ficha</button></div></form></div>
</div>
<script src="../scripts/publications-editor.ts"></script>
<style>.publication-workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px}.publication-workspace aside{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:8px}.publication-workspace aside button{padding:12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);cursor:pointer}.publication-workspace aside button.active{border-color:var(--forest);box-shadow:inset 4px 0 var(--forest)}.post-cover-preview{width:100%;max-height:260px;object-fit:cover;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line)}@media(max-width:850px){.publication-workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr}.publication-workspace aside{grid-auto-flow:column;overflow:auto}.publication-workspace aside button{min-width:210px}}</style>
